From 26fbfef2ecc4d3192ff605b23c9a4bb02e781171 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: vince <vincepaul.liem@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 6 Nov 2026 18:39:08 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] feat(launch): mediate configured TCP through public
 descriptors

Connect only explicitly granted numeric endpoints through bounded supervisor
sockets. Reuse descriptor aliases, process ownership, readiness and strict
vector copies. Retain undelivered receive bytes and failed connection state,
and preserve per-call deadlines while the supervisor waits for progress.

Signed-off-by: vince <vincepaul.liem@gmail.com>
